{
  "dashboard": {
    "id": null,
    "title": "SaaS Backend - SRE Golden Metrics",
    "tags": ["saas", "backend", "sre", "golden-metrics"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 1,
    "refresh": "30s",
    "time": {
      "from": "now-1h",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        {
          "name": "environment",
          "type": "custom",
          "query": "production,staging,development",
          "current": {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "production",
            "value": "production"
          },
          "options": [
            { "text": "Production", "value": "production", "selected": true },
            { "text": "Staging", "value": "staging", "selected": false },
            { "text": "Development", "value": "development", "selected": false }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "app",
          "type": "custom",
          "query": "saas-backend-template",
          "current": {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "saas-backend-template",
            "value": "saas-backend-template"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "SRE Golden Metrics Overview",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "options": {
          "content": "# SRE Golden Metrics Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard displays the four golden signals of monitoring:\n- **Latency**: How long it takes to service a request\n- **Traffic**: How much demand is being placed on your system  \n- **Errors**: The rate of requests that fail\n- **Saturation**: How full your service is",
          "mode": "markdown"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "Request Rate (Traffic)",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
            "legendFormat": "Requests/sec"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "reqps",
            "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
            "thresholds": {
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "yellow", "value": 100 },
                { "color": "red", "value": 1000 }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "center",
          "orientation": "horizontal"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "title": "Error Rate",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 3 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_errors_total{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m])) * 100",
            "legendFormat": "Error Rate %"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "percent",
            "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
            "thresholds": {
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
                { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "center"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "title": "Average Response Time (Latency)",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 3 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "avg(http_request_duration_ms{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"})",
            "legendFormat": "Avg Latency"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "ms",
            "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
            "thresholds": {
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "yellow", "value": 500 },
                { "color": "red", "value": 2000 }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "center"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "title": "System Saturation",
        "type": "gauge",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 3 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "avg(resource_utilization_percent{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\", resource=\"cpu\"})",
            "legendFormat": "CPU %"
          },
          {
            "expr": "avg(resource_utilization_percent{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\", resource=\"memory\"})",
            "legendFormat": "Memory %"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "percent",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "thresholds": {
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "yellow", "value": 70 },
                { "color": "red", "value": 90 }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "values": false,
            "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
            "fields": ""
          },
          "orientation": "auto",
          "showThresholdLabels": false,
          "showThresholdMarkers": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "title": "Request Rate Over Time",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (endpoint) (rate(http_requests_total{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}}"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "reqps",
            "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
          "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "title": "Response Time Distribution",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_request_duration_ms_bucket{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "50th percentile"
          },
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_ms_bucket{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "95th percentile"
          },
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_request_duration_ms_bucket{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "99th percentile"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "ms",
            "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "title": "Error Rate by Endpoint",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (endpoint, status_code) (rate(http_requests_total{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\", status_code=~\"4..|5..\"}[5m]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}} - {{status_code}}"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "reqps",
            "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "title": "Rate Limiting Activity",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 19 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (endpoint, type) (rate(rate_limit_exceeded{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}} - {{type}} limit"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "reqps",
            "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "title": "Top Endpoints by Traffic",
        "type": "table",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "topk(10, sum by (endpoint) (rate(http_requests_total{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m])))",
            "format": "table",
            "instant": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "custom": {
              "displayMode": "auto",
              "filterable": true
            }
          }
        },
        "transformations": [
          {
            "id": "organize",
            "options": {
              "excludeByName": {
                "Time": true,
                "__name__": true,
                "app": true,
                "environment": true
              },
              "renameByName": {
                "endpoint": "Endpoint",
                "Value": "Requests/sec"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "title": "Function Performance Metrics",
        "type": "table",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 27 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "avg by (function) (function_duration_ms{app=\"$app\", environment=\"$environment\"})",
            "format": "table",
            "instant": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "ms",
            "custom": {
              "displayMode": "auto",
              "filterable": true
            }
          }
        },
        "transformations": [
          {
            "id": "organize",
            "options": {
              "excludeByName": {
                "Time": true,
                "__name__": true,
                "app": true,
                "environment": true
              },
              "renameByName": {
                "function": "Function",
                "Value": "Avg Duration (ms)"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "overwrite": true
}
